<html lang="ja"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><title>取手｜競輪シミュレーター</title></head>
<body><main><header><div class="eyebrow">KEIRIN SIMULATOR · PHASE 01</div><h1>取手 <span>盤面から、展開が生まれる。</span></h1><div class="tags"><span>9車</span><span>400mバンク</span><span>4倍速</span><span>真上固定</span></div></header>
<section class="board"><div class="status"><strong id="phase">発走待機</strong><span id="remaining">2025 m</span></div><canvas id="bank" aria-label="取手バンクを近似した盤面と9車の走行位置"></canvas><div class="controls"><button id="start">START</button><button id="pause" disabled>PAUSE</button><button id="reset">RESET</button></div><p class="hint">STARTで発走。RESETで同じ配置から新しい走行へ。</p></section>
<section class="telemetry"><div><small>経過時間</small><strong id="time">0.0 s</strong></div><div><small>接触</small><strong id="contacts">0</strong></div><div><small>横接触</small><strong id="side">0</strong></div></section>
<div id="riders" class="riders" aria-label="全9車の状態"></div><p id="result" role="status">着順はゴール通過時に確定します。</p>
<footer>公式図・公式寸法による近似バンク。実測形状の再現ではありません。<br/>2025m（5周＋25m）／先頭の残り1周で全車のレーン制を解除。<br/><a href="https://www.toride-keirin.com/guide">取手競輪場・公式バンクガイド ↗</a></footer></main></body></html>
<script>import '../sim/view.mjs';</script>
<style is:global>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#101b21;color:#eaf2ed;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}main{max-width:960px;margin:auto;padding:32px 20px}header{margin-bottom:24px}.eyebrow{color:#9dbaab;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em}h1{font-size:38px;margin:12px 0 18px}h1 span{font-size:14px;font-weight:400;color:#adc0b8;margin-left:12px}.tags{display:flex;gap:8px}.tags span{border:1px solid #344940;border-radius:20px;padding:5px 10px;font-size:11px}.board{border:1px solid #3d5148;border-radius:18px;background:#182a2b;overflow:hidden}.status{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px;color:#c8e4ac;font-size:13px}canvas{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.9}.controls{display:flex;gap:10px;padding:18px 20px 0}button{flex:1;padding:14px 8px;border:1px solid #5c7268;background:transparent;color:#eef5ed;border-radius:8px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;cursor:pointer}#start{background:#c6e8a7;color:#18291f;border-color:#c6e8a7}button:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:default}.hint{font-size:11px;color:#9fb4ac;text-align:center;margin:14px 8px 20px}.telemetry{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin:20px 0}.telemetry div{padding:14px;border-bottom:1px solid #344940}small{display:block;color:#9fb4ac;font-size:11px}strong{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.telemetry strong{display:block;margin-top:5px;font-size:21px}.riders{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(9,1fr);gap:7px}.rider{text-align:center;font-size:10px;color:#b6c9bf}.badge{display:grid;place-items:center;width:29px;height:29px;margin:0 auto 7px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #a6b4ac;font-weight:800;font-size:16px}#result{font-size:13px;min-height:24px;color:#d6e9c4}footer{font-size:11px;line-height:1.9;color:#91a79d;margin-top:26px}a{color:#b4cda8}@media(max-width:500px){main{padding:24px 12px}h1{font-size:31px}h1 span{display:block;margin:6px 0 0}.status{padding:16px}.riders{gap:2px}.badge{width:25px;height:28px}.rider{font-size:9px}.controls{padding:12px 12px 0;gap:7px}}
</style>
